sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Session A (LISTEN)
    participant DB as job_status_changes
    participant B as Session B

    Note over A,B: Scenario 1 - NOTIFY then COMMIT
    A->>DB: LISTEN portsmith_test
    B->>DB: BEGIN
    B->>DB: NOTIFY portsmith_test, 'hello'
    Note right of A: nothing yet - not committed
    B->>DB: COMMIT
    Note right of A: still nothing - no round-trip yet
    A->>DB: SELECT 1;
    DB-->>A: notification delivered
    Note over A,B: Delivered on A's next round-trip after commit

    Note over A,B: Scenario 2 - NOTIFY then ROLLBACK
    B->>DB: BEGIN
    B->>DB: NOTIFY portsmith_test, 'should never arrive'
    B->>DB: ROLLBACK
    A->>DB: SELECT 1;
    Note right of A: nothing arrives - ever
